WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:04.700
Hey, Ryuto. I want to do it with you.

00:09.350 --> 00:10.820
Are you sure?

00:11.290 --> 00:12.140
Yeah.

00:29.190 --> 00:30.890
Shirakawa-san...

00:34.280 --> 00:38.550
Ryuto, you're warm. This is so relaxing.

00:39.010 --> 00:40.060
No.

00:40.500 --> 00:41.520
What's the matter?

00:43.560 --> 00:45.190
You aren't Shirakawa-san.

00:47.720 --> 00:49.050
Are you...

00:57.830 --> 01:00.600
Kurose-san?

01:13.420 --> 01:20.050
<b>Our Dating Story: 
The Experienced You and The Inexperienced Me</b>

02:32.000 --> 02:37.460
<b>Our Cheating Story:</b>

02:32.520 --> 02:37.460
<b>The Experienced You Cheats with</b>

02:33.020 --> 02:37.460
<b>an Experienced Someone Else?</b>

02:36.440 --> 02:38.920
Why are you he—

02:39.210 --> 02:43.370
My battery died, 
so I'm borrowing Maria's phone.

02:44.450 --> 02:46.470
So the phone call, too?

02:50.530 --> 02:51.440
That's right.

02:51.810 --> 02:57.420
Runa and I don't look alike, but we sound 
exactly the same. Especially over the phone.

02:57.420 --> 02:59.160
But why, then?

02:59.160 --> 03:00.390
I already told you.

03:00.910 --> 03:03.370
I want to do it with you!

03:04.830 --> 03:10.040
If you want me to, I can keep
 pretending to be Runa. So... okay?

03:10.040 --> 03:12.750
Wh-What are you talking about?
 That's so weir—

03:13.250 --> 03:20.220
I can... I can still give you 
my first time. Unlike her.

03:28.160 --> 03:32.250
Please. Do it with me.

03:34.320 --> 03:38.040
I won't tell anyone. I won't even tell Runa.

03:45.500 --> 03:47.920
I don't have to become your girlfriend.

03:47.920 --> 03:52.230
But in exchange, 
will you choose me just this one time?

03:55.680 --> 03:56.420
I can't do that.

03:57.590 --> 03:58.800
There's no way.

03:58.800 --> 03:59.880
Why not?

04:00.760 --> 04:02.340
Why not...?

04:05.170 --> 04:11.560
I want to keep Shirakawa-san smiling. 
I don't want to do anything to betray her.

04:12.560 --> 04:14.330
And if we do this...

04:14.840 --> 04:15.770
Kashima-kun...

04:16.390 --> 04:18.230
It wouldn't be fair for you, either.

04:38.930 --> 04:40.630
Is somebody there?

04:59.120 --> 05:00.570
Kurose-san...

05:07.300 --> 05:09.280
Can I ask you one thing?

05:13.650 --> 05:17.100
Did you call me here to get revenge 
against Shirakawa-san?

05:17.610 --> 05:19.200
Would you really go that far?

05:19.200 --> 05:20.180
No!

05:21.210 --> 05:22.670
It isn't like that!

05:25.800 --> 05:27.550
You've got it totally wrong.

05:27.550 --> 05:29.140
But in that case, why?

05:30.690 --> 05:32.100
Because I like you.

05:32.500 --> 05:33.540
Huh?

05:34.920 --> 05:36.470
I like you.

05:38.290 --> 05:41.570
I just wanted to do it with you!

05:41.570 --> 05:42.780
Huh?!

05:42.780 --> 05:48.240
I like you. Ever since you called me out 
for spreading rumors about Runa.

05:48.570 --> 05:50.040
Wh-Why?

05:51.050 --> 05:54.890
I wonder why. 
Maybe because it was a first for me.

05:54.890 --> 05:57.680
You were so direct, so sincere...

05:57.680 --> 06:02.090
You're the first boy 
who has ever confronted me like that.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.960
Just now, too. 
You didn't stop just for Runa's sake.

06:05.960 --> 06:08.780
You turned me down to protect me, Kashima-kun.

06:08.780 --> 06:09.590
But that's...

06:09.590 --> 06:11.800
It was honestly so hard for me.

06:11.800 --> 06:14.800
Even if I had done it, 
I still wouldn't have become Runa.

06:14.800 --> 06:17.370
I still couldn't be your number one.

06:17.370 --> 06:18.660
Kurose-san...

06:19.140 --> 06:21.620
But I still couldn't hold back my feelings.

06:21.620 --> 06:26.180
I knew I shouldn't, I knew it was wrong, 
but I couldn't help liking you more and more.

06:27.200 --> 06:31.530
It hurt so much, 
but I didn't know what to do about it!

06:35.140 --> 06:36.750
This was my first time.

06:36.750 --> 06:37.500
Huh?

06:38.150 --> 06:43.350
Falling for someone. 
And of course I get rejected.

06:45.840 --> 06:46.670
Kurose-san...

06:47.120 --> 06:50.730
I guess this is how you felt 
that time, Kashima-kun.

06:51.320 --> 06:54.380
I had no idea it could hurt so much.

06:54.950 --> 06:56.350
I'm sorry, Kashima-kun!

06:57.890 --> 07:00.500
I'm really so sorry.

07:02.710 --> 07:03.830
Kurose-san...

07:04.360 --> 07:10.200
<i>No. If I act too nice to her now, 
it would just make her suffer more.</i>

07:13.480 --> 07:16.580
Please... I won't cry for long.

07:17.240 --> 07:22.100
Just for now, just for a minute, 
let me stay like this.

07:29.560 --> 07:34.840
<i>Kurose-san didn't say another word 
before she went home. I hope she's okay.</i>

07:32.260 --> 07:36.220
<b>Kurose Maria</b>

07:36.220 --> 07:40.980
Can you promise me you'll never do 
anything to make her worry about that?

07:41.420 --> 07:44.910
<i>Yeah, it's time I cut 
Kurose-san off completely.</i>

07:44.910 --> 07:49.100
<i>Today, I'll tell Runa that she's the girl 
I asked out in middle school, so...</i>

07:47.680 --> 07:49.100
Seriously?

07:49.100 --> 07:50.350
That guy?

07:50.350 --> 07:51.560
No way.

07:51.990 --> 07:53.750
Eww.

07:56.950 --> 08:00.170
Kasshi! What the hell are you doing?

07:59.910 --> 08:00.740
Uh...

08:00.170 --> 08:02.440
Dude, everyone's talking about you.

08:02.440 --> 08:04.840
Are you really cheating with Kurose-san?

08:04.840 --> 08:05.710
Huh?

08:05.710 --> 08:07.340
This, this!

08:07.800 --> 08:09.800
It got sent around last night.

08:19.770 --> 08:21.460
<i>Kurose-san...</i>

08:30.850 --> 08:32.460
It wasn't me, okay?

08:33.680 --> 08:34.860
Okay.

08:34.860 --> 08:39.880
I mean, spreading rumors after I got 
turned down flat yesterday?

08:39.880 --> 08:42.400
I'd never do something that desperate.

08:42.400 --> 08:44.980
I still have some sense of pride.

08:44.980 --> 08:45.830
Sorry.

08:45.830 --> 08:50.510
No, I'm sorry for getting you
 mixed up in this. I'll deny the rumors,

08:50.510 --> 08:53.800
and I won't contact you anymore. 
You can go ahead and block me.

08:53.800 --> 08:55.100
All right.

08:57.400 --> 08:58.940
Should we get back to class?

09:00.550 --> 09:02.390
Hey, Kashima-kun.

09:03.780 --> 09:07.900
If I had said okay when you 
asked me out way back then,

09:08.310 --> 09:12.650
I wonder if I would have been 
the one with you now.

09:13.240 --> 09:14.090
Kurose-san...

09:14.090 --> 09:16.820
But oh well! There's no point 
worrying about that anymore.

09:18.070 --> 09:19.080
Let's go.

09:25.590 --> 09:26.980
Ryuto...

09:29.790 --> 09:34.760
Is that true? Is she the one 
who turned you down back then?

09:35.070 --> 09:36.410
I'm sorry, I just...

09:36.410 --> 09:38.090
Why are you sorry?

09:38.970 --> 09:41.680
Have you done something 
you need to apologize for?

09:44.880 --> 09:46.430
Don't you run!

09:46.430 --> 09:47.350
Ryuto?

09:49.810 --> 09:51.120
No, it's... not like that!

09:51.120 --> 09:52.500
I don't want to hear it!

09:53.030 --> 09:55.850
Why, Ryuto?

09:57.670 --> 10:01.300
I hate this! I can't take it!

10:03.270 --> 10:04.410
Shirakawa-san!

10:16.080 --> 10:17.590
You're disgusting.

10:19.550 --> 10:21.100
You piece of shit!

10:24.680 --> 10:27.640
So, for that reason,

10:27.960 --> 10:30.840
remain diligent during summer 
vacation and behave in a way

10:30.840 --> 10:35.240
that reflects positively on your position 
as a student of this school.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.940
That is what I ask of you.

10:38.030 --> 10:40.730
<i>Why did things turn out like this?</i>

10:41.320 --> 10:43.340
<i>That question kept running through my head.</i>

10:46.950 --> 10:47.750
<b><b>Do you really want to block Ryuto? 
This will prevent you from receiving their messages. 
To unblock later, go to 
[Settings] -> [Friends] -> [Block List].</b></b>

10:46.950 --> 10:47.750
m 0 0 l 300 0 300 70 0 70

10:46.950 --> 10:47.750
<b>Cancel</b>

10:46.950 --> 10:47.750
<b>Block</b>

10:46.950 --> 10:49.920
<b>Friends</b>

10:46.950 --> 10:49.920
<b>Friends</b>

10:46.950 --> 10:49.920
<b>Yada-san</b>

10:47.750 --> 10:49.920
<b>Rikube-san</b>

10:47.750 --> 10:49.920
<b>Riho</b>

10:48.160 --> 10:49.920
<b>Nagarekawa-kun</b>

10:50.580 --> 10:56.260
<i>What could I have done differently 
to have kept Shirakawa-san from crying?</i>

10:57.210 --> 10:59.420
Hey, wanna check it out on the way home?

10:59.420 --> 11:00.180
Sure.

10:59.760 --> 11:05.510
<i>Even after the closing assembly ended, 
Shirakawa-san didn't come back.</i>

11:18.790 --> 11:22.590
For that reason, the Japanese 
translation here should be,

11:21.820 --> 11:24.280
<b>Intensive Two-Week Course H.S. Year 2 English A</b>

11:22.590 --> 11:27.280
"Electronic communication will never be 
a substitute for the face of someone

11:27.280 --> 11:32.830
who with their soul encourages 
another person to be brave and true."

11:27.750 --> 11:30.880
<i>And so I began a very gray summer vacation.</i>

11:30.880 --> 11:32.830
<i>I wanted to apologize to Shirakawa-san</i>

11:32.830 --> 11:35.790
<i>and sent her messages every day for two weeks,</i>

11:37.750 --> 11:40.220
<b>I'm sorry about before... 
I want to meet so I can explain</b>

11:37.750 --> 11:40.220
<b>Shirakawa-san, are you okay?
 Can you talk tonight?</b>

11:37.750 --> 11:40.220
<b>I want to talk to you.</b>

11:37.750 --> 11:41.400
<i>but no matter how many I sent, 
they were never read.</i>

11:37.920 --> 11:40.220
<b>Good morning.</b>

11:41.400 --> 11:42.930
<i>I didn't know what to do,</i>

11:43.590 --> 11:45.510
<i>so I even went to her house a few times.</i>

11:49.490 --> 11:53.190
<i>But, wimp that I was, 
I couldn't take the last step.</i>

11:54.280 --> 11:56.110
This is a really important part...

11:56.110 --> 11:59.910
<i>I tried to pretend that nothing 
happened and hid inside my studies.</i>

12:01.760 --> 12:03.340
<i>I'm disgusting.</i>

12:05.430 --> 12:06.990
The glowing sunshine,

12:07.280 --> 12:08.830
the glittering waves...

12:08.830 --> 12:10.660
Welcoming to families and children,

12:10.990 --> 12:14.670
and even geeks like us. The wonderful beach!

12:14.670 --> 12:17.380
The ocean in Chiba is the best!

12:19.840 --> 12:21.820
So, uh, what now?

12:24.320 --> 12:26.800
Oops. KEN just uploaded a new video.

12:28.400 --> 12:30.380
Oh, sorry!

12:31.110 --> 12:32.730
<i>'Kay, let's do this.</i>

12:32.730 --> 12:34.280
<i>One more time...</i>

12:33.570 --> 12:34.410
Here I go!

12:34.410 --> 12:37.480
Was there any point to us
coming to the beach?

12:37.480 --> 12:38.400
Good point.

12:39.160 --> 12:41.260
I'm starving.

12:39.650 --> 12:43.360
<i>Okay. Got him. You clear? Okay.</i>

12:41.260 --> 12:43.360
Wanna get yakisoba?

12:46.450 --> 12:48.660
How dare you, beach in Chiba!

12:48.660 --> 12:52.120
Beach, you traitor! 
You were supposed to be friendly to us!

12:52.410 --> 12:55.660
All right. Let's make a strategic 
withdrawal and find another shop.

12:55.660 --> 12:57.920
I saw an older-looking place over—

12:57.920 --> 12:59.260
Hey! Isn't that...?

12:59.260 --> 13:02.090
Huh? Huh?!

13:04.050 --> 13:08.630
See? This isn't the time to be 
fooling around at the beach.

13:06.120 --> 13:10.540
<i>It's the last day, and everything is 
going in one ear and out the other.</i>

13:10.540 --> 13:12.760
<i>Paying for cram school was a waste.</i>

13:14.980 --> 13:16.440
<b>Today</b>

13:14.980 --> 13:16.440
<b>Yusuke</b>

13:14.980 --> 13:16.440
<b>Hey, your girlfriend's cheating on 
u man!!!!!</b>

13:14.980 --> 13:19.770
This is really important, 
so be sure to drill it into your heads.

13:30.240 --> 13:31.950
<b>Onjuku Station</b>

13:31.950 --> 13:33.220
<i>I'm an idiot!</i>

13:34.040 --> 13:36.820
<i>Shirakawa-san is always so forgiving.</i>

13:37.170 --> 13:39.800
<i>She always put my feelings first.</i>

13:39.800 --> 13:44.990
<i>Even now, I took her kindness 
for granted and let my guard down.</i>

13:44.990 --> 13:47.700
<i>Even after how I made her feel.</i>

13:49.140 --> 13:50.810
<i>I'm disgusting.</i>

13:56.560 --> 13:59.770
<b>Shirakawa-san is at a
 clubhouse-type place called 
LUNAMARINE</b>

14:00.120 --> 14:01.610
Lunamarine...

14:04.240 --> 14:07.350
Mommy, I found my tube.

14:08.340 --> 14:09.700
Ready to shoot?

14:10.180 --> 14:11.370
Say chinsuko.

14:14.620 --> 14:17.790
Come on, chinsuko? This is Chiba!

14:17.790 --> 14:21.250
Hey, it's good. Gets us in the mood anyway.

14:21.250 --> 14:23.710
Okay, let's get one more.

14:24.660 --> 14:26.120
Shirakawa-san...

14:26.120 --> 14:29.180
Hey, Mao-kun. Let's take a picture!

14:29.180 --> 14:30.970
A picture?

14:38.310 --> 14:39.660
Come on, come on!

14:39.660 --> 14:41.310
What a pain.

14:41.310 --> 14:43.790
You sure are friendly with Mao-kun.

14:43.790 --> 14:46.280
Well yeah, I don't get to see him much.

14:46.280 --> 14:50.090
Fine, but I still got work, so just one, okay?

14:51.960 --> 14:55.710
Welcome, sir. Are you headed into the water?

14:55.710 --> 14:56.700
Uh, no...

14:57.000 --> 14:57.710
Huh?

14:57.000 --> 14:58.160
Wha?!

14:59.000 --> 15:00.170
Ryuto...

15:03.270 --> 15:04.760
Sh-Shirakawa-san!

15:04.760 --> 15:08.340
There's something I really need to say to you.

15:10.870 --> 15:14.260
I'm sorry. I realize it might be too late.

15:23.620 --> 15:27.320
Oh, wait. Are you the boyfriend 
dude Runa was talking about?

15:29.280 --> 15:33.240
Yeah, yeah? Come by train? 
Must've taken a while.

15:34.680 --> 15:35.700
Um...

15:35.700 --> 15:39.660
Oh, sorry. Forgot the "nice to meet you" part.

15:40.250 --> 15:41.870
<b>Kurose Mao</b>

15:42.480 --> 15:44.600
How's it goin'? I'm Runa's uncle.

15:44.600 --> 15:46.590
Thanks for keeping an eye on my niece.

15:46.590 --> 15:48.840
Huh? Uncle?

15:55.960 --> 15:57.180
So?

15:57.640 --> 15:58.620
Uh...

15:59.960 --> 16:04.000
I don't give a damn how you found out, 
but where'd you get the balls to show up here?

16:04.000 --> 16:05.640
Nicole...

16:05.640 --> 16:09.050
If I don't like your answer, 
you're getting a piece of this.

16:09.050 --> 16:14.290
Hey, now. Boyfriend-kun came 
all the way out here in this heat.

16:14.290 --> 16:17.800
Nicole-chan, you said you have 
work later, right? Are you good for time?

16:17.800 --> 16:18.750
Oh, crap.

16:18.750 --> 16:20.010
Go ahead, Nicole.

16:20.010 --> 16:21.140
But...

16:22.040 --> 16:23.790
I'll be fine.

16:23.790 --> 16:28.230
Sure she will. If he makes my dear niece cry,
 I'll string him up myself.

16:28.920 --> 16:30.760
Then call me tonight.

16:30.760 --> 16:31.510
Okay.

16:32.400 --> 16:34.330
Enjoy yourselves, kids.

16:48.080 --> 16:52.320
Kurose-san is the girl who turned me 
down that time in middle school.

16:55.240 --> 16:57.320
Sorry I couldn't tell you before.

16:58.450 --> 17:00.990
I wasn't trying to keep it from you, but...

17:01.680 --> 17:05.740
<i>What the hell am I doing? I came 
all the way here and still can't say it?</i>

17:07.480 --> 17:11.130
The night after we came back from the beach, 
Kurose-san told me she likes me.

17:13.090 --> 17:16.940
But I turned her down! 
I told her I was with you.

17:19.260 --> 17:25.230
And then she started crying. I think 
that's when someone took the picture.

17:25.760 --> 17:27.260
I won't make excuses.

17:27.260 --> 17:31.780
I know I hurt you, Shirakawa-san. 
I made you worry.

17:32.820 --> 17:34.330
I'm really sorry.

17:36.710 --> 17:38.160
No.

17:38.840 --> 17:43.620
I'm the one who should be sorry.
I know you're not like the other guys.

17:44.960 --> 17:49.090
It's nobody's fault. I mean...

17:49.460 --> 17:54.050
I get why Maria fell for you. I really do.

17:56.010 --> 18:00.830
I know she looks strong,
 but she's actually really sensitive and pure.

18:00.830 --> 18:04.490
If she confessed her feelings to you, 
then she must have really meant it.

18:06.420 --> 18:09.440
And you stayed with her while she was crying.

18:09.440 --> 18:12.830
Yeah. Looking back on it, 
that was pretty thoughtless of me.

18:12.830 --> 18:14.650
Of course people would get the wrong idea.

18:15.020 --> 18:21.620
No, no. You were just trying to be 
kind to her, like you always are with me.

18:21.980 --> 18:24.830
You didn't abandon her when she was crying.

18:25.200 --> 18:27.130
As her big sister, that makes me happy.

18:30.100 --> 18:32.100
Thank you, Ryuto.

18:33.860 --> 18:36.120
Ah, youth.

18:37.960 --> 18:40.550
But then why couldn't I get 
hold of you all this time?

18:40.550 --> 18:43.960
Oh. My phone broke when I dropped it.

18:43.960 --> 18:48.020
I brought it with me, 
but there are no shops nearby.

18:48.020 --> 18:51.480
I finally got to the next town over 
yesterday and dropped it off for repairs.

18:51.860 --> 18:54.190
You mean you weren't angry at me?

18:54.690 --> 18:57.530
Nah. Sorry.

18:58.120 --> 18:59.240
Huh?

18:59.990 --> 19:03.720
To be honest, I was scared to ask you about it.

19:06.930 --> 19:11.120
I've been so happy since we started dating,

19:11.470 --> 19:14.720
I wasn't really thinking about 
the possibility of you breaking my trust.

19:14.720 --> 19:18.490
But I felt so exposed, and when 
I realized how much I might be hurt,

19:18.490 --> 19:20.590
I got too scared to find out for sure.

19:23.050 --> 19:25.800
But that didn't feel right either.

19:25.800 --> 19:32.120
I wanted to keep dating you no matter 
what happened. I decided to face reality,

19:33.350 --> 19:35.520
so I finally took my phone to get repaired.

19:36.950 --> 19:37.980
But then,

19:38.790 --> 19:43.910
before it was even fixed, 
you came all the way here to see me.

19:44.400 --> 19:46.060
Shirakawa-san.

19:54.610 --> 19:57.250
Wait. How did you know where to find me?

19:57.670 --> 19:59.590
Oh, about that...

20:05.460 --> 20:07.280
What a great summer.

20:07.280 --> 20:08.510
I know, right?

20:12.480 --> 20:16.250
Oh, dear. You came quite a way, didn't you?

20:16.250 --> 20:20.670
H-How do-do you do? Shirakawa Runa-san 
has been kind enough to date me!

20:20.670 --> 20:22.150
My name is Kashima Ryuto!

20:23.660 --> 20:26.220
Thank you for taking care of my Ru-chan.

20:26.220 --> 20:29.760
I don't have much here, 
but please make yourself at home.

20:29.760 --> 20:32.040
Ah, yes! Thank you very much!

20:32.040 --> 20:33.800
Granny Sayo, is the bath warmed up?

20:33.800 --> 20:34.870
It sure is.

20:35.590 --> 20:38.890
In that case, the first bath goes to our guest.

20:38.890 --> 20:39.920
Huh?

20:39.920 --> 20:42.220
You're staying the night, right?

20:42.220 --> 20:43.520
No, I...

20:43.520 --> 20:47.050
Don't be shy, man. You're already here.

20:47.050 --> 20:49.800
Anyway, cool. Thanks, Granny.

20:49.800 --> 20:50.860
Of course.

20:50.860 --> 20:52.460
What's on the menu tonight?

20:52.460 --> 20:53.930
We're having fish.

20:54.340 --> 20:57.430
Fish again? I need red meat.

20:59.570 --> 21:00.780
Um...

21:00.780 --> 21:03.400
Sorry. That's just the way Mao is.

21:03.980 --> 21:05.880
Relax and come on in.

21:06.210 --> 21:09.310
Granny Sayo is my mom's mother.

21:09.310 --> 21:13.210
I don't see my mom much
because it'd probably bother my dad,

21:13.210 --> 21:15.330
but I figure Granny Sayo is safe.

21:15.330 --> 21:16.660
Oh, okay.

21:19.200 --> 21:24.230
Hey, Ryuto. Will you stay with me 
for the rest of the summer?

21:24.920 --> 21:26.330
Yeah, of course.

21:27.200 --> 21:30.430
Then it's decided! 
Stay here with me until I go back.

21:30.800 --> 21:31.890
Huh?

21:31.890 --> 21:36.810
We can get part-time jobs at Lunamarine, 
and when we're free we can play in the ocean.

21:36.810 --> 21:38.830
There's even a festival coming up!

21:38.830 --> 21:39.860
What?!

21:40.330 --> 21:42.710
Let's have the best summer ever together!

21:44.200 --> 21:45.800
Y-Yeah.

21:48.180 --> 21:51.080
<i>I can't take it. She's too cute!</i>

23:26.250 --> 23:27.960
On the next Our Dating Story,

23:27.960 --> 23:32.470
the experienced you and the 
inexperienced me go to a summer festival.

23:32.900 --> 23:36.810
Summer, ocean, yukata,
 and fireworks and stuff.

23:36.810 --> 23:37.970
Chill enough for you?

23:37.970 --> 23:39.980
<b>Our Festival Story: The Experienced You
 and the Inexperienced Me
Go to a Summer Festival.</b>
